# 01: the drum grid. Placing hits, a held A + the stick for level and nudge, chance with Y.
title THE DRUM GRID
about Placing hits on the drum grid while the song plays: A places, hold A and a direction shapes a hit, Y sets its chance, B deletes.
caption DRUMS
run --demo --view drums
from 1.0
length 17.0

1.2 say The drum grid, with the song playing.
2.0 tap RIGHT 2 0.3
2.8 tap A
2.8 say A places a hit.
3.4 tap RIGHT 3 0.3
4.4 tap A
5.4 say Hold A and press down or up: the hit gets softer or louder.
5.4 hold A 2.8
5.8 tap DOWN 4 0.3
7.2 tap UP 2 0.3
8.6 say Hold A and press right: the hit plays a little late.
8.6 hold A 1.6
9.1 tap RIGHT 2 0.4
10.8 say Y on a hit lowers its chance: now it plays only sometimes.
11.0 tap Y
11.8 tap Y
13.0 say B deletes it.
13.4 tap B
14.4 say Y on an empty step places a maybe hit.
14.6 tap LEFT
15.2 tap Y
